  "releaseNotes": "- Added PDTagInput: a tag input component rendering values as removable chips, with optional autocomplete suggestions, free-text entry, validation limits (MaxTags, MaxTagLength, suggestions-only mode) and full keyboard support. Supports two-way binding via @bind-Values (List of string), TagAdded/TagRemoved/TagRejected events, a custom TagTemplate, and theming via --pd-taginput-* CSS variables (light/dark aware via Bootstrap theme variables)",
